              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Likh. 2.26—3.11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nono bano bali babaami be sibala nisio Baisiraeli baula mala baamba kamaloba engelekha owa Yoritani, khukhwama khu litooma lia Arinoni khukhwola sikulu sia Herimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala aaba Sihoni, omwami owe Baamori owaamiia khukhwama e Heshiboni. Bubwami bwewe bwamalatana khukhwama Aroeri (khundulo khwe litooma lia Arinoni) ne lukoba luli akari",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lukoba luli akari:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "likaluukhasia linyala liaba liang'ali (lola 13.16, ne Likh. 2.36) lukoba luli akari Lueburania se lulikho ne kamakhuwa kano tawe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " we litooma elio, khukhwola khu luuchi lwa Yaboki luli lulwakha lwa Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bubwami buno bwoola khu litooma lia Yoritani khukhwama khu nyanja eya Chumbe, ebunafubo owa Beti-yeshimoti (ebukwe we Enyanja eya chumbe) ne khukhwola mumaayo mwe sikulu sia Pisika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisiraeli lundi baula omwami Oku owe Bashani, owaba mulala khu Barefaimu babarama, owamiia khukhwama e Asitaroti ne Etirei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bubwami bwewe bwaambaania sikulu sia Herimoni, Saleka ne Bashani yoosi khukhwola khu baandu Bakesiuri ne Bamaaka. Oki lundi amiia silala khu bibili sie sibala sio mwami Sihoni owa Heshiboni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
